!docs
docs/*
!docs/deployment
docs/deployment/*
!docs/deployment/native-runner
!docs/deployment/native-runner/**

# Keep exclusions effective after allowing the packaged scanner directory.
**/node_modules
**/.preflyt
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/*.env
**/docker-tls

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
